1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,007
What is a context window?

2
00:00:02,247 --> 00:00:06,252
Think of it as the model's desk: the text it can consider in one go.

3
00:00:06,492 --> 00:00:09,208
Add too much conversation, and the desk fills.

4
00:00:09,448 --> 00:00:13,211
The app may trim or summarize older notes to fit the next request.

5
00:00:13,551 --> 00:00:17,621
So context is what the model can use right now, not permanent memory.

6
00:00:17,861 --> 00:00:21,108
Bigger windows hold more, but every window has a limit.

